{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DPTvSf84cC1795647075.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>現貨金價一度跌穿3,500美元，但最終倒升收市。</p><p></p><p>至於紐約期金，收市報3,535.8美元一盎司，跌26.1美元，跌幅百分之0.7。</p><p></p><p>美國新公布的通脹數據高過市場預期，未能紓緩加息預期，拖累現貨金價一度跌至3,426.77美元，跌130.08美元，跌幅百分之3.6。但隨著美股反彈，金價反彈至3,587.21美元收市，倒升30.36美元，升幅百分之0.8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T23:57:37.254723+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T22:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:57:10.832421+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T23:50:52.781335+00:00","content_hash":"1b2175fde13717d97cf7f2b9164f7c23fe584ecccf2d99d7c87ff3095adbf376","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T23:57:37.254723+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}